  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infection prevention and awareness in remote Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PHASE Nepal&apos;s existing Himalayan Healthcare project has been providing primary healthcare and maternity services in remote areas and also responding successfully to the COVID-19 pandemic. Further this project aims to address the risks of communicable diseases and limited healthcare-seeking behavior by conducting community and school-level programs to raise health awareness and improve long-term healthcare-seeking behavior.</narrative>
  </description>
